#lego-legacy-route 1
# LEGO Island, from its boot through its intro to its Information Center's
# idle loop (#121).
#
# Nothing on the way is pressed. The boot and first light are
# first-light.route's. The intro plays, and at flip 3200 the Information
# Center is drawn. The Infomaniac walks in, talks, and goes to stand by the
# right rail, where the room idles; at flip 4937 he walks over beside the
# info desk by himself. From flip 5099 the room holds one loop of 120 frames
# for as long as nobody touches it: 88 still, and 32 in which the brick on the
# desk rocks.
